  ('Energy Star', 'water', 'A government website that provides savings on energy efficient home appliances, called ENERGY STAR certified products. Enter your ZIP code to find rebates and special offers near you on ENERGY STAR certified products.', 'https://www.energystar.gov/', 'Enter your ZIP code to find rebates and special offers near you on ENERGY STAR certified products.', 'US', null, 'federal', 'Working', null),
